{"decision": "repair", "edits": [{"start_line": 300, "end_line": 348, "replacement": "            if (r_cmd_state == 3'h0)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                    ll_cmd_dat <= r_data_reg[31:24];
                    r_cmd_crc_stb <= 1'b1;
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h1)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                    ll_cmd_dat <= r_data_reg[23:16];
                    r_cmd_crc_stb <= 1'b1;
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h2)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                    ll_cmd_dat <= r_data_reg[15:8];
                    r_cmd_crc_stb <= 1'b1;
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h3)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                    ll_cmd_dat <= r_data_reg[7:0];
                    r_cmd_crc_stb <= 1'b1;
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h4)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                    ll_cmd_dat <= cmd_crc;
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h5)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    ll_cmd_dat <= 8'hff;
                    if (r_have_resp)
                    begin
                        if (r_use_fifo)
                            r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                        else
                            r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h2;
                        ll_fifo_rd <= (r_use_fifo)&&(r_fifo_wr);
                        if ((r_use_fifo)&&(r_fifo_wr))
                            ll_cmd_dat <= 8'hfe;
                    end
                end
            end else if (r_cmd_state == 3'h6)
            begin
                if (ll_idle)
                begin
                    ll_cmd_dat <= 8'hff;
                    if (ll_fifo_rd_complete)
                    begin 
                        r_cmd_state <= r_cmd_state + 3'h1;
                        ll_fifo_rd <= 1'b0;
                    end else if (ll_fifo_rd)
                        ll_cmd_dat <= fifo_byte;
                end
            end else 
                ll_cmd_dat <= 8'hff;"}], "explanation": "The command state machine was advancing every clock cycle without waiting for the low-level SPI module to be ready (ll_idle). This caused bytes to be overwritten before the low-level module could accept them, leading to incorrect MOSI output. The fix adds ll_idle guards to each state transition so that each command byte (argument bytes, CRC, and dummy 0xFF bytes) is only presented when the low-level module signals it can accept a new byte."}
